{"type":"message","id":"dc32e021","parentId":"f549ad37","timestamp":"2026-06-12T06:43:34.210Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"exec_ts_ZTI0ODMwYTctNWNkNi00MmZlLTk5OGItZWU1MzllNzJiOWMz","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"META\n- SEO Title: Coinbase AI Agents Arrive: New Tool Manages Portfolios\n- Meta Description: Coinbase AI agents are here with the launch of a new tool that allows users to automate crypto trading and portfolio management. Learn how it works.\n- URL Slug: coinbase-ai-agents-portfolio-management\n- Categories: Emerging Memecoin Platforms, Ai meme coins\n- Primary Keyword: Coinbase AI agents\n- Secondary Keywords: AI agent financial tooling, Coinbase Advisor, AI-driven trade guidance, agentic token holders\n\n---\n\n# Coinbase AI Agents Debut to Automate Crypto Trading and Portfolio Management\n\nThe new Coinbase AI agents are now live with the official launch of \"Coinbase for Agents,\" a tool designed to connect AI systems directly to user accounts. This development allows systems to trade cryptocurrencies, make payments, and manage portfolios on behalf of users within predefined guardrails. The move signals a significant step into the world of AI-driven finance, as major players like [Coinbase](https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-launches-tool-letting-ai-agents-make-payments-and-trade-crypto?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound) and others are rapidly developing AI agent financial tooling.\n\nAccording to Coinbase, the tool gives AI agents access to both financial information and transaction capabilities. This enables them to analyze portfolios and execute actions within limits set by the user. The platform is available through a Model Context Protocol (MCP) integration for web-based AI assistants like ChatGPT and Claude, as well as a command-line interface for developers using tools such as Hermes Agent, Anthropic’s Claude Code, and OpenAI Codex. The goal is to make crypto management more autonomous, reducing the need for constant manual oversight from users. As [reported](https://decrypt.co/370835/coinbase-tool-ai-agents-trade-crypto-make-payments), this could include tasks like allocating funds to reward programs or setting up recurring buys.\n\n## The Vision for Autonomous Finance\n\nCoinbase's vision extends beyond simple automation. The company aims to position AI agents as a primary way for people to interact with the internet and their finances. Lincoln Murr, head of AI product at Coinbase, stated, \"We believe agents are no longer a niche developer curiosity, but really a primary way people interact with the internet.\" This forward-looking perspective highlights the potential for AI to revolutionize how investors approach the crypto market."}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":25,"aggregated":"META\n- SEO Title: Coinbase AI Agents Arrive: New Tool Manages Portfolios\n- Meta Description: Coinbase AI agents are here with the launch of a new tool that allows users to automate crypto trading and portfolio management. Learn how it works.\n- URL Slug: coinbase-ai-agents-portfolio-management\n- Categories: Emerging Memecoin Platforms, Ai meme coins\n- Primary Keyword: Coinbase AI agents\n- Secondary Keywords: AI agent financial tooling, Coinbase Advisor, AI-driven trade guidance, agentic token holders\n\n---\n\n# Coinbase AI Agents Debut to Automate Crypto Trading and Portfolio Management\n\nThe new Coinbase AI agents are now live with the official launch of \"Coinbase for Agents,\" a tool designed to connect AI systems directly to user accounts. This development allows systems to trade cryptocurrencies, make payments, and manage portfolios on behalf of users within predefined guardrails. The move signals a significant step into the world of AI-driven finance, as major players like [Coinbase](https://cointelegraph.com/news/coinbase-launches-tool-letting-ai-agents-make-payments-and-trade-crypto?utm_source=rss_feed&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound) and others are rapidly developing AI agent financial tooling.\n\nAccording to Coinbase, the tool gives AI agents access to both financial information and transaction capabilities. This enables them to analyze portfolios and execute actions within limits set by the user. The platform is available through a Model Context Protocol (MCP) integration for web-based AI assistants like ChatGPT and Claude, as well as a command-line interface for developers using tools such as Hermes Agent, Anthropic’s Claude Code, and OpenAI Codex. The goal is to make crypto management more autonomous, reducing the need for constant manual oversight from users. As [reported](https://decrypt.co/370835/coinbase-tool-ai-agents-trade-crypto-make-payments), this could include tasks like allocating funds to reward programs or setting up recurring buys.\n\n## The Vision for Autonomous Finance\n\nCoinbase's vision extends beyond simple automation. The company aims to position AI agents as a primary way for people to interact with the internet and their finances. Lincoln Murr, head of AI product at Coinbase, stated, \"We believe agents are no longer a niche developer curiosity, but really a primary way people interact with the internet.\" This forward-looking perspective highlights the potential for AI to revolutionize how investors approach the crypto market.","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781246614209}}
